      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُدُورَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَدُورَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَادُورَةٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>A flow,</i> or
